stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Measuring
    Cached --> Measuring: Census schema is missing or changed
    Measuring --> Held: Missing field lacks decisive evidence
    Measuring --> Held: Conflict or overflow is proved
    Measuring --> Captured: Shared predicate accepts field
    Held --> Measuring: Next source generation arrives
    Captured --> Measuring: Next source generation arrives
    Measuring --> Published: Aggregate equations reconcile
    Measuring --> Refused: Generation or counts disagree
    Published --> Published: Interrupted replacement preserves previous bundle
